{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for nearby object, approach and take it in order to inspect. Otherwise scan area. Do it now. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
    "BT": {
